# Runtime.MiRust.com Retired

Runtime.MiRust.com is retired as a separate documentation authority.

Current developer portal:
- https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/developer-portal/

Current public browser-local app:
- https://tinyrustlm.com/

Preserved legacy runtime archive:
- https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/docs/runtime-portal/index.md
- https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/docs/runtime-portal/MANIFEST.md

Machine-readable current exports:
- https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/llms.txt
- https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/llms-full.txt
- https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/docs/package-manifest.md

Boundary:
- Runtime.MiRust.com should redirect only.
- TinyRustLM.MiRust.com is the current developer documentation portal.
- TinyRustLM.com is the current browser-local Rust/WASM app.
- Project servers do not run user model bytes.
- Project servers do not serve runnable user model bytes.
